=====Usage notes=====
The [[oblique case]]s of singular '''''дитя''''', except for the [[accusative case]], are never used in speech or modern prose writing. Instead, the corresponding cases of {{m|ru|ребёнок}} are used. The plural forms are standard and in common use, and serve as the normal plural forms of {{m|ru|ребёнок}}.

